// CONTRACT BEAT (seeded by the lead; owned by north): asserts hasBadge(blaze).
// The engine keeps the gym shut until canPass(cinderGymDoor).

## The stage

::bg{location="blaze-gym" time="day"}
::music{action="change" mood="tense" volume="normal"}
@narrator: The last quiz machine buzzes, and the floor opens onto a stage ringed with gas jets. They light one after another, all the way round.
@narrator{when="holds(defeated(blazeGymSuperNerdQuill)) && holds(defeated(blazeGymSuperNerdOona))"}: Somewhere behind the stage, two very clever people are sulking about their quiz scores.

## Ignatius

::use{component="gymLeader" who="ignatius" badge="blaze" intro="Welcome, welcome! I am Ignatius, keeper of the Blaze Gym, and I have one last question for you: can your team take the heat? Let's find out!" win="Correct! Gloriously correct! I am extinguished! Take the Blaze Badge, you have earned every spark of it." lose="Ooh, wrong answer! Cool off and try again." prize="4800"}
@ignatius{when="@wonFight" emotion="laughing"}: You found my key in that old house, didn't you? I left it there so only the brave would come. And the curious. Mostly the curious.
@ignatius{when="@wonFight"}: The last gym is in Verdant City. I have never met its leader. Nobody has. Be careful, eh?
